<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Thermo Bio rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Thermo Bio rated outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Jonathan Cohen started coverage of Thermo Bioanalysis Corp with an outperform rating, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst set a 12- to 18-month target price of $16-1/8 on Thermo Bioanalysis and projected the company would earn $0.34 per share in 1996 and $0.71 in 1997, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 13-1/2 Thursday.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1736</p>
